# Mutation plan for the plugin API's user, status, preference and team methods
# (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-users.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_user_methods_answer_as_go_answers`: 97 API
# calls from inside MessageWillBePosted on a Go host and a Rust host, every answer, every hook the
# writes fire, and every frame the own user's socket receives. One line is a unit mutation
# (`plugin_api::users`), because no script call can reach a refused option shape. The last two
# lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

